' 2. Log in (password or Google)
' Use case: Log in, «extend» Sign in with Google · Actor: Guest · Secondary: Google
'
' Design patterns:
'   - Chain of responsibility: middleware chain, rateLimit per account and per network (drawn once here)
'   - Abstract factory / Strategy: sharedState() builds the RateLimitStore and NonceStore, in memory (one API process)
'     or in PostgreSQL (several processes), chosen by SHARED_STATE (shared-state/index.ts)
'   - Adapter + Dependency injection: «interface» GoogleTokenVerifier → GoogleLibraryVerifier wraps Google's library,
'     injected into createGoogleSignInService (services/google/)
'   - Decorator: action() around the controllers
'   - Repository
' Lifelines use BCE stereotypes: «boundary» screens and outside services, «control» use-case logic (controllers,
' services, and the adapter interfaces in front of outside services), «entity» stored data (repository, stores);
' the database keeps its own symbol.
@startuml 02 Log in
title 2. Log in (password or Google)
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Guest
boundary "Web app" as Web
control "Middleware chain" as MW
entity "«interface»\nRateLimitStore /\nNonceStore" as Shared
control "Auth controller" as Ctrl
control "Auth service" as Svc
control "«interface»\nGoogleTokenVerifier" as Verifier
entity "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB
boundary "Google" as Google

alt password
  Guest -> Web : username or email + password
  Web -> MW : POST /api/auth/login
  note over MW : «Chain of responsibility»\nheaders → CORS → rateLimit → controller
  MW -> Shared : count attempt (account, network)
  note right of Shared : «Abstract factory»\nMemory or PostgreSQL\nversion (SHARED_STATE)
  alt over the limit
    MW --> Web : 429
  end
  MW -> Ctrl : login()
  Ctrl -> Svc : login(identifier, password)
  Svc -> Repo : find user
  Repo -> DB : SELECT
  alt not found or wrong password (bcrypt)
    Svc --> Web : 401
  else account suspended
    Svc --> Web : 403
  end
  Svc -> Repo : record last login
  Svc --> Ctrl : session token (with token version)
  Ctrl --> Web : { token, role }
  Web --> Guest : admin → /admin, learner → dashboard

else Google
  Web -> MW : GET /api/auth/google/nonce
  MW -> Ctrl : googleNonce()
  Ctrl -> Shared : store one-time nonce
  Ctrl --> Web : nonce
  Guest -> Google : choose an account
  Google --> Web : ID token (contains the nonce)
  Web -> MW : POST /api/auth/google (ID token)
  MW -> Ctrl : googleSignIn()
  Ctrl -> Svc : signIn(idToken)
  Svc -> Verifier : verify(idToken)
  note right of Verifier : «Adapter» GoogleLibraryVerifier\nwraps Google's library;\ntests inject a fake («DI»)
  Verifier -> Google : signing keys
  Verifier --> Svc : email, Google id, nonce
  Svc -> Shared : use nonce once
  alt Google account already linked
    Svc -> Repo : find user by Google id
  else new email
    Svc -> Repo : registration open? create account (no password)
    Repo -> DB : INSERT
  end
  Svc --> Ctrl : session token
  Ctrl --> Web : { token, role }
  Web --> Guest : signed in
end
@enduml
